ully\n- Failure Point: CARD_ISSUANCE validation step\n- Error Code: TECHNICAL_FAILURES (null reference during network comparison)\n\n**Recommendation:**\n1. Update the application's `cardNetwork` section to include a valid network (e.g., `[\"VISA\"]`)\n2. Verify UI validation rules enforce network selection during submission\n3. Check if recent schema changes made this field mandatory\n\n@omkaram - Please confirm if network selection was intentionally omitted. We'll need to:\n- Add missing card network preference\n- Retry provisioning after correction\n- Update validation checks to prevent future occurrences\n\nAssigning to Omkar for data correction and validation review."}}}, {"toolUse": {"toolUseId": "tooluse_dbP93GEXRAij5rt_48QMkA", "name": "jira_update_issue", "input": {"issue_key": "TRC-28931", "fields": {"assignee": {"name": "omkaram@zeta.tech"}}}}}]}}, "stopReason": "tool_use", "usage": {"inputTokens": 9091, "outputTokens": 568, "totalTokens": 9659}, "metrics": {"latencyMs": 19553}}


